SUMMARY:Deadline: Sadler's Wells Digital Stage: The Future Remembers\, thre
 e GBP 6\,000 dance-film commissions
DESCRIPTION:Sadler's Wells Digital Stage commissions three new Dance on Scr
 een films of up to four minutes on the theme The Future Remembers\, asking
