SUMMARY:Deadline: MOPGA 2027: Visiting Fellowship Program for Early Career 
 Researchers (France)
DESCRIPTION:Tenth call of Make Our Planet Great Again\, a French government
  visiting fellowship for early career researchers to spend 12 months in a 
 French laboratory.\n\nOrganisation: Campus France\, for the French Ministr
 y for Europe and Foreign Affairs and the Ministry of Higher Education\, Re
 search and Space\nLocation: France (host laboratory of the applicant's cho
 ice)\nAward: EUR 2\,500 a month for 12 months\, plus a EUR 500 settling-in
  allowance and health\, civil liability and repatriation insurance. Intern
 ational travel is not covered.\nDuration: 12 months\, starting between Sep
 tember and December 2027\n\nMore: https://www.campusfrance.org/en/mopga-20
 27?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
